<title>NEW ZEALAND: Colonial Motor 1st half net up 17 percent.</title>
<headline>Colonial Motor 1st half net up 17 percent.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    6.17 vs 5.27</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   11.6 vs 15.0</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    8.5 vs 15.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			    190.64 vs 213.87</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 7.99 vs 7.86</p>
<p>    Tax				     1.78 vs 2.51</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   30.95 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries 4.19 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date April 7</p>
<p>Reg date March 27</p>
<p>    Ex div   March 31</p>
<p>Note - The Colonial Motor Company Ltd is a property investor and motor company.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
